graph TD
    A[Chromatin Modification Signal] --> B{Remodeling Type?}
    B -->|SWI/SNF| C[SWI/SNF Complex]
    B -->|ISWI| D[ISWI Complex]
    B -->|CHD| E[CHD Complex]
    B -->|INO80| F[INO80 Complex]
    
    C --> G[Histone Displacement]
    G --> H[Nucleosome Sliding]
    H --> I[Chromatin Remodeling]
    
    D --> J[Nucleosome Spacing]
    J --> K[Chromatin Organization]
    K --> I
    
    E --> L[Histone Exchange]
    L --> M[Chromatin Modification]
    M --> I
    
    F --> N[Histone Variant Exchange]
    N --> O[Chromatin Restructuring]
    O --> I
    
    I --> P[Chromatin Remodeling Complete]
    
    %% Regulation
    P --> Q[Chromatin Status]
    Q --> R{Transcription Required?}
    R -->|Yes| S[Remodeling Activation]
    R -->|No| T[Remodeling Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    U[SWI/SNF] --> C
    V[ISWI] --> D
    W[CHD] --> E
    X[INO80] --> F
    Y[Histones] --> G
    Z[ATPases] --> H
    AA[Chromatin Proteins] --> I
    
